  "content": "\n\n<p>傳奇 Herobrine - 終極首領戰體驗</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 將神話中的 Herobrine 傳說轉化為史詩級的 Boss 戰，即使是最資深的《我的世界》玩家也將面臨嚴峻挑戰！此模組將 Herobrine 具現化為一名擁有 300 點生命值、進階 AI、毀滅性武器與驚人元素能力的強大 Boss。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 支持開發者</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 喜歡這個模組嗎？請考慮支持未來的開發：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpolitas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Politas</a></p>\n<h1><strong>如何召喚 Herobrine！</strong></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304552/description_6eeefdac-24e1-486a-be85-e98453fe6980.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"458\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304552/description_ed40d063-e7ce-4ded-9ab5-653a11031c83.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"437\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304552/description_ecadf219-8c0f-484d-9ecc-5651a48e27e6.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"537\" height=\"460\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304552/description_77ec79a4-4732-47fb-bad1-2f46d78bb10a.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"537\" height=\"283\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304552/description_1e96cb1c-6b9a-421f-81e3-d12ad068d201.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"534\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304552/description_0e63fba5-3392-4614-b977-b657532253f2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"534\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304552/description_efee52b1-225c-4eb9-bcba-30d60649f043.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"534\" height=\"266\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yMd30EiEm2E\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
